    "article_summary": "This article describes a visible-light-driven dual photoredox/nickel-catalyzed carboxylation of (hetero)aryl and vinyl bromides using sodium formate as a CO2 source. A key finding is the essential role of phenyl triflimide as a catalytic sulfonylating agent/HAT catalyst that promotes the reaction under mild conditions, avoiding the need for gaseous CO2 or harsh organometallic reagents.",
